WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.356
Let's connect WhatsApp Business to Recatch.

00:00:03.426 --> 00:00:05.047
It uses the WhatsApp Cloud

00:00:05.047 --> 00:00:06.481
API, with your own Meta

00:00:06.481 --> 00:00:07.479
app for now.

00:00:07.779 --> 00:00:09.540
Step one. Create your

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:11.720
account at recatch.app.

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:13.627
On the Create your workspace

00:00:13.627 --> 00:00:15.529
screen, enter your name, your

00:00:15.529 --> 00:00:17.104
email, and a password of

00:00:17.104 --> 00:00:18.797
at least 8 characters.

00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:20.345
Then click Create account.

00:00:20.645 --> 00:00:21.666
Step two. You land

00:00:21.666 --> 00:00:23.221
on the Channels screen.

00:00:23.291 --> 00:00:25.492
Under Connect a channel, click WhatsApp.

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:28.393
Step three. In Meta for Developers,

00:00:28.393 --> 00:00:30.501
add WhatsApp to your app.

00:00:30.571 --> 00:00:32.103
Create a system-user token

00:00:32.103 --> 00:00:35.181
with the whatsapp_business_messaging permission.

00:00:35.251 --> 00:00:37.204
Then copy the Phone number ID

00:00:37.204 --> 00:00:39.204
from WhatsApp → API Setup.

00:00:39.274 --> 00:00:41.508
These values are fake examples.

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:43.453
Never share your real token

00:00:43.453 --> 00:00:44.712
or app secret.

00:00:45.012 --> 00:00:47.191
Step four. Paste the Phone number

00:00:47.191 --> 00:00:49.687
ID and the Permanent access token.

00:00:49.757 --> 00:00:52.304
Adding your App secret is recommended.

00:00:52.304 --> 00:00:55.169
It's used to verify webhook signatures.

00:00:55.469 --> 00:00:57.744
Step five. Click Connect account.

00:00:58.044 --> 00:01:00.356
Recatch now shows a Callback URL

00:01:00.356 --> 00:01:02.595
and a Verify token, under Paste

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:04.868
into the Meta App dashboard.

00:01:05.168 --> 00:01:07.613
Step six. Paste both into WhatsApp

00:01:07.613 --> 00:01:10.451
webhooks, and subscribe to messages.

00:01:10.751 --> 00:01:13.016
That's it. WhatsApp is connected.

00:01:13.086 --> 00:01:14.839
Next, build your first flow,

00:01:14.839 --> 00:01:16.904
from the lead-capture template or

00:01:16.904 --> 00:01:18.093
a blank canvas.
